    "wacc_rationale": "USD flows, USD rate. Risk-free ~4.3% (10y UST), ERP 5.0%, beta ~0.85 for a defensive-leaning discretionary retailer -> cost of equity ~8.5%. Debt is $2.87B against ~$149B market cap and the company is net cash, so WACC ~= cost of equity: 8.5%, the same in every scenario (risk is charged through the scenario paths and weights, not the rate).",
